sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant onm
    participant scan
    participant ui
    participant delete

    User->>onm: onm [path] [flags]
    onm->>scan: discover and enrich node_modules
    scan-->>onm: sizes, ages, package counts
    onm->>ui: summary and picker
    ui->>User: choose directories
    User-->>ui: selection and confirmation
    ui->>delete: selected targets
    delete->>delete: safety check
    delete-->>ui: removal result
    ui-->>User: Freed TOTAL from N directories
